    "physical_description": "Bed cover of embroidered blue linen with thick cotton thread and a little wool in red, orange, blue, pink, yellow and white in stem, flat, satin, running and large back stitches. A central wavy edged roundel contains plants which are repeated in the corners. Lozenges, containing leafy stems, are set diagonally across the corners and the remainder of the ground is covered with birds, stars and other shapes. A border containing a curving leafy stem runs round the outside.",
